CODA Data Washing Machine Comparator - attribution and terms

This repository contains DWM-derived code plus local CODA/TahaComparator-CX
comparator work, benchmark tooling, data files, and documentation.

Use, redistribution, and modification of inherited DWM portions must respect the
rights and terms of the original DWM authors. Local additions in this repository
should be attributed to this repository and its contributors when reused.

When publishing work that depends on this repository, cite:

- this repository: https://github.com/MaTaha-ualr/DataWashingMachineClassic
- the original DWM work when discussing the base Data Washing Machine pipeline

This software is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind, express or
implied.
